	<string name="hwp.mercenary.off">Mercenary mode is off (HammerwatchPlus settings, or hwp set mercenary.enabled true).</string>
	<string name="hwp.mercenary.not_merc">%name% is not a mercenary. A fresh level-1 character can enlist (hwp merc enlist) once another character of its class has reached level %level%.</string>
